; cursors.paths -- the pointers as shapes, which tools/mkfont rasterizes
; for scale 2 (user/lib/ui/face.l0), with smooth edges. Its language is
; tools/mkfont/shape.l0's. The pointer is "cursor" then its shapes, each
; white or black, in the pointer's pixels at scale 1, its hot spot at 0,
; 0, the black drawn over the white; and another pointer is "cursor
; NAME", the same, its hot spot in its middle, where paint.l0's
; ui_cursor_hot_x and ui_cursor_hot_y say. The toolkit's icons are
; GNOME's SVGs, under icons/.

; Adwaita's pointer: a black arrow edged white.
cursor
white fill M 0 0 L 11.5 11.5 L 7 11.5 L 9.8 16.6 L 7.4 17.6 L 4.7 12.3 L 0 15.8 Z
black fill M 1 2.4 L 9.1 10.5 L 5.4 10.5 L 8.4 16.1 L 7.9 16.3 L 4.9 10.7 L 1 13.6 Z

; The I-beam over text: a black bar with a serif at either end, edged
; white, about its hot spot, 5.5, 10.5, the middle of paint.l0's 1x art.
cursor text
white fill M 2 2 L 9 2 L 9 5 L 7 5 L 7 16 L 9 16 L 9 19 L 2 19 L 2 16 L 4 16 L 4 5 L 2 5 Z
black fill M 3 3 L 8 3 L 8 4 L 6 4 L 6 17 L 8 17 L 8 18 L 3 18 L 3 17 L 5 17 L 5 4 L 3 4 Z

; The resize pointers: a black arrow with a head at both ends, edged
; white, across, up and down, and on the diagonals, each about its hot
; spot, in the middle of paint.l0's 1x art of it.
cursor ew-resize
white fill M 2.09 6.5 L 8 0.59 L 8 5 L 15 5 L 15 0.59 L 20.91 6.5 L 15 12.41 L 15 8 L 8 8 L 8 12.41 Z
black fill M 3.5 6.5 L 7 3 L 7 6 L 16 6 L 16 3 L 19.5 6.5 L 16 10 L 16 7 L 7 7 L 7 10 Z

cursor ns-resize
white fill M 6.5 2.09 L 12.41 8 L 8 8 L 8 15 L 12.41 15 L 6.5 20.91 L 0.59 15 L 5 15 L 5 8 L 0.59 8 Z
black fill M 6.5 3.5 L 10 7 L 7 7 L 7 16 L 10 16 L 6.5 19.5 L 3 16 L 6 16 L 6 7 L 3 7 Z

cursor nwse-resize
white fill M 2.84 2.84 L 11.21 2.84 L 8.09 5.96 L 13.04 10.91 L 16.16 7.79 L 16.16 16.16 L 7.79 16.16 L 10.91 13.04 L 5.96 8.09 L 2.84 11.21 Z
black fill M 3.84 3.84 L 8.79 3.84 L 6.67 5.96 L 13.04 12.33 L 15.16 10.21 L 15.16 15.16 L 10.21 15.16 L 12.33 13.04 L 5.96 6.67 L 3.84 8.79 Z

cursor nesw-resize
white fill M 2.84 16.16 L 2.84 7.79 L 5.96 10.91 L 10.91 5.96 L 7.79 2.84 L 16.16 2.84 L 16.16 11.21 L 13.04 8.09 L 8.09 13.04 L 11.21 16.16 Z
black fill M 3.84 15.16 L 3.84 10.21 L 5.96 12.33 L 12.33 5.96 L 10.21 3.84 L 15.16 3.84 L 15.16 8.79 L 13.04 6.67 L 6.67 13.04 L 8.79 15.16 Z
